Z||000000||vinnywolfe||07-21-2000||05:56 PM||||i was driving back from finishing up working on my 87 gt last night (it's taken me about a year and i'm anxious to drive her), anyway, at a stop light a newer probe gt seemed to be "getting on it" and i wasn't that impressed.  i think those have a dohc v6 in them and i don't see how that 2.8 could handle that (maybe off the line 'cause of more low end torque?).<BR>anyone eaten of of these for breakfast, cause i'm getting hungry<P>thanks,<BR>vinny<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||5
